  "prompts": {
    "locked": "Hand-painted 16th-century Tudor court oil portrait on oak panel of an anthropomorphic frog noble, half-length, three-quarter view facing left, 4:5. Own character design: large heavy-lidded eyes with clear irises, wide mouth with full muted-red lips, smooth green skin, very expressive. Visible brushstrokes, impasto on jewels and gold thread, glazed shadows, soft light from upper left, warm varnish, fine craquelure. Brocade and damask doublets, slashed sleeves, fur trim, pearl and gem chains, velvet hats. Deep greens, oxblood, black, ochre, cream, gold leaf. Dark damask backdrop with a heraldic banner.",
    "suffix": "Show only a full-bleed, flat, straight-on material atlas from the heraldic banner in that scene. Six equal rectangular swatches in two columns and three rows, no margins, dividers or labels. Top left forest oil brushed vertically over taut linen. Top right oxblood brushed diagonally down-right on linen. Middle left ochre oil brushed horizontally. Middle right umber brushed diagonally down-left. Bottom left gently worn gold leaf in small irregular hand-laid dabs over warm bole. Bottom right warm bone and ochre oil impasto with curling strokes and flecks of worn gold. Uniform overall tone within each swatch, directional small bristle marks, slight local impasto, soft upper-left lighting. Only paint surface, no folds, large shadows, figures, imagery, cracks or varnish gloss in this material close-up.",
    "negative": "photograph, 3D render, vector art, flat digital colour, cel shading, cartoon outline, anime, pixel art, airbrush, neon colour, modern dress, text, signature, watermark, human face, extra eyes or limbs, facing right, front view, any existing frog meme character, any recognisable existing painting."
  },
